    "body": "Correct, only one thread can access a SyncAccessHandle.   Having them be more similar to WritableFileStream and (not in the spec) AccessHandle has some benefit, but as mentioned (and mentioned in the meeting) having the API be a mix of async and sync accesses is odd and can cause confusing/problematic issues.\r\nAt the moment, I've implemented these as sync under the hood, and just immediately resolve the promise.",
