    "updated_at": "2022-11-11T19:25:01Z",
    "body": "Can we close this issue? #55 makes the SyncAccessHandle interface entirely sync, so queueing async operations is no longer relevant.\r\n\r\nThere's a separate question of whether there should be a \"parallel queue\" for locking. I've opened #74 for that",
